Merge adjacent terminated `if` statements with same content

```js
if (a) { b; return d } if (c) { b; return d }
if (a || c) return b, d;
```

extend minification of exit-point to handle `if` consequent that are block statements ending in a terminating statement.

```js
if (a()) { b(); return; } c();
//              ^~~~~~~   ^~~~ move remaining stmts to else branch and remove jump stmt
if (a()) b(); else c();
// now we can collapse it to ternary if enabled
a() ? b() : c();
```

fixes #25489
